# IEEE 118 student cells, cell A (2026-10-13): the first DAgger round of the frozen
# IEEE 14 student on IEEE 118, with the teacher that opens the spectra first on the
# triage classifier's harmonic call (docs/triage_family_scores_20261013.md).  The
# settings are those of the 2026-10-11 transfer cell (ieee118_transfer_20261011.env):
# the balanced and waveform families without topology, the classifier-gated profile
# with the joint IEEE 14 + 118 gate, the excess progress basis and the stop tolerance
# for unverifiable expert labels.  What differs is the chain: d0 regenerates the
# expert aggregate with the new teacher (the 2026-10-11 aggregate demonstrates the
# phasor detour on every harmonic root), r1c collects with the frozen adapter under
# the new teacher's labels, r1t continues the adapter for one pass on the 1:1
# mixture, and r1e scores the frozen student, the adapted candidate and the expert
# on the development roots.  The suite, the balanced corpus and the waveform corpora
# are taken from the 2026-10-11 cell before submission
# (research/hpc/full_pipeline_20260907/launch_student_cells_20261013.sh), so the
# development roots are the 124 of the zero-shot result (student 101/124, expert
# 119/124); check_suite_exclusion.py confirms after stage 0 that the regenerated
# aggregate drew the same roots as the 2026-10-11 one and none of the suite's.
# Deploy and submit both cells from Windows (SSH master up):
#   bash research/hpc/full_pipeline_20260907/launch_student_cells_20261013.sh
# which runs, for this cell, PIPE=/scratch/yx3882/research_full_pipeline_20261013_ieee118_student
# SOURCE_CELL=/scratch/yx3882/research_full_pipeline_20261011_ieee118 BASE=bf22a8d
# OVERRIDES=ieee118_student_20261013.env deploy_cell_from_windows.sh <commit40> and then
# CHAIN="d0 r1c r1t r1e" bash submit_pipeline.sh.
SYSTEM=case118
ADMISSION_MODE=recoverable
EVIDENCE_PROFILE=classifier_gated_diagnostics
HIF_SIGNATURE_MODE=discovered
EXPERT_VARIANT=baseline
# Global progress on the chi-square excess over the degrees of freedom (the IEEE 118
# rule of the 2026-10-11 cell: one correct meter repair of a multi-meter root removes
# 7-10% of the whole statistic but 25-50% of the excess).
PROGRESS_BASIS=chi_square_excess
# An expert label the audit cannot verify ends its episode and is recorded (the
# recovery_options_exhausted handoffs behind spurious multiplier signatures).
UNVERIFIED_EXPERT_LABEL_POLICY=stop
# Balanced corpus under $OUT/corpus: copied from the 2026-10-11 cell before stage 0
# (same counts, scans and load-scale range), so stage 0 builds nothing here.
CORPUS_COUNTS='{"no_error": 300, "measurement_error": 900, "parameter_error": 900}'
CORPUS_NUM_SCANS=3
CORPUS_LOAD_SCALE_MIN=0.80
CORPUS_LOAD_SCALE_MAX=1.25
# The waveform corpora of research/classifier_triage/ieee118_dataset (pipeline_corpus:
# admitted HIF and unbalance windows of the IEEE 118 three-phase model at the AC-OPF
# dispatch, phasors at the PMU sigma 1e-4); $PIPE/corpora is a link to the 2026-10-11
# cell's upload.  Harmonic roots are synthesized by the generator.
HIF_CORPUS_TRAIN=$PIPE/corpora/hif_samples.jsonl
HIF_CORPUS_VALID=
HIF_CORPUS_TRAIN_EXTRA=
HIF_CORPUS_VALID_EXTRA=
IMBALANCE_CORPUS=$PIPE/corpora/unbalance_samples.jsonl
# The joint IEEE 14 + 118 gate (residual_v2 view, thresholds 0.096 / 0.338); its
# report now carries the family scores and the harmonic call (spectra_admitted).
TRIAGE_CLASSIFIER=$SRC/psse_env/oracle/models/triage_gnn_joint_20261011
# The expert aggregate of stage 0, regenerated with the spectra-first teacher: the
# nine non-topology families, 92 roots, as in the 2026-10-11 cell (same seed, so the
# same roots are drawn and the copied suite's exclusion holds; checked after stage 0).
D0_PLAN='{"no_error": 8, "measurement": 12, "multi_measurement": 10, "parameter": 12, "measurement+parameter": 12, "harmonic": 10, "hif": 10, "measurement+hif": 8, "three_phase_unbalance": 10}'
ROUND_TRAIN_PLAN='{"no_error": 2, "measurement": 3, "multi_measurement": 2, "parameter": 3, "measurement+parameter": 3, "harmonic": 3, "hif": 3, "measurement+hif": 2, "three_phase_unbalance": 3}'
DEVELOPMENT_PLAN='{"no_error": 8, "measurement": 16, "multi_measurement": 12, "parameter": 16, "measurement+parameter": 16, "harmonic": 16, "hif": 16, "measurement+hif": 8, "three_phase_unbalance": 16}'
# Student for round 1: the round-2 adapter of the 2026-10-07 classifier-gated cell
# (IEEE 14, same profile), linked as this run's bc0 by stage 0; r1t continues it.
FROZEN_STUDENT_ADAPTER=/scratch/yx3882/research_full_pipeline_20261007_classifier/out/r2/training/lora
FROZEN_STUDENT_EVIDENCE_PROFILE=classifier_gated_diagnostics
ZEROSHOT_EVAL_NAME=zeroshot
PREVIOUS_PIPE=
